====================

Sub question 1: Find the PostId of the post with the title "Group differences on a five point Likert item".

```sql
SELECT `Id`
  FROM posts
  WHERE `Title` = 'Group differences on a five point Likert item'
```

Sub question 2: Retrieve the PostId and comments (Text) for the post identified in sub question 1.

```sql
SELECT `Id`, `Body`
  FROM posts
  WHERE `Id` = (
    SELECT `Id`
      FROM posts
      WHERE `Title` = 'Group differences on a five point Likert item'
  )
```

Final SQL: List the PostId and the comment text(s) for the post titled "Group differences on a five point Likert item".

```sql
SELECT p.`Id`, c.`Text`
  FROM posts AS p
  LEFT JOIN comments AS c
    ON p.`Id` = c.`PostId`
  WHERE p.`Title` = 'Group differences on a five point Likert item'
```

**Question Solved.**

